Senior AI Researcher

Nov 2023 - Mar 2026 · 2 yrs 5 mos

• Led research on large-model inference, multimodal serving, and model efficiency, taking projects from research prototype through large-scale evaluation, publication, patenting, and open-source/product integration.
 • Project lead for EPD Disaggregation, an encode–prefill–decode architecture for multimodal model serving that reduced memory requirements by up to 15× and TTFT by up to 71%; published at ICML 2025.
